From bf27816e48f79a07b3edd6b1308e81f4b4c22810 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:00:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: switch Prisma to PostgreSQL for Vercel/Neon deployment

- prisma/schema.prisma: provider = postgresql, binaryTargets includes rhel-openssl-3.0.x
  (Vercel build environment uses RHEL with OpenSSL 3.x)
- package.json: added postinstall script (prisma generate runs on Vercel install),
  added @prisma/adapter-neon, simplified build script (no standalone copy needed on Vercel)
- next.config.ts: removed output: standalone (Vercel handles automatically),
  added satuordasy.com and *.vercel.app to allowedOrigins for Server Actions
- src/app/page.tsx + src/app/zhk/[slug]/page.tsx: dynamic = force-dynamic, revalidate = 0
  (these pages query DB and must render at request time, not at build time)
- src/lib/settings.ts: getPrivacyPolicy wrapped in try/catch for build time
- Without these changes Vercel build fails with:
  'Error validating datasource db: the URL must start with the protocol file:'
  because schema.prisma said sqlite but DATABASE_URL was postgres://...
